{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the virtual world of <i>GigaSlave</i>, you will take on the role of an agent, tackling various plot-driven challenges and engaging in real combat against other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features and Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolling Horizontal Shooter Cooperative Mode: This gameplay is similar to titles like <i>Metal Slug</i> and <i>Contra</i>. The key difference is that it supports up to 16 players to team up and complete levels together, with clear rewards for successful completion.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Player Skill Duel: Players can freely combine a variety of weapons such as sniper rifles and assault rifles, then fight side by side with teammates against players from opposing factions on the horizontal battlefield.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social System and Village System: Beyond battles, players can move to the leisure village to conduct activities like buying, selling, setting up stalls, and trading the items/ firearms they\u2019ve acquired. They can also form their own teams to grow and progress together.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628370?t=1771634253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628370?t=1771634253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/ccf9764cbbc727be8aa7d3f545c92c19d5275751/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771634253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/ccf9764cbbc727be8aa7d3f545c92c19d5275751/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771634253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"d