uels.</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-testing PVP player duels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.poster.avif?t=1771634253\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.webm?t=1771634253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/extras/15dbd8785e23e3978f253c0bcf517f75.mp4?t=1771634253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the virtual world of <i>GigaSlave</i>, you will take on the role of an agent, tackling various plot-driven challenges and engaging in real combat against other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features and Modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolling Horizontal Shooter Cooperative Mode: This gameplay is similar to titles like <i>Metal Slug</i> and <i>Contra</i>. The key difference is that it supports up to 16 players to team up and complete levels together, with clear rewards for successful completion.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Player Skill Duel: Players can freely combine a variety of weapons such as sniper rifles and assault rifles, then fight side by side with teammates against players from opposing factions on the horizontal battlefield.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social System and Village System: Beyond battles, players can move to the leisure village to conduct activities like buying, selling, setting up stalls, and trading the items/ firearms they\u2019ve acquired. They can also form their own teams to grow and progress together.</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Gnisoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628370/09ae94e6fcf4c1361342235f92210259e523a719/header.jpg?t=1771634253","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3628370/766660504/be9b3f32ea6114f99d427d0de44aa7ceb9e2f6f3/1750457164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750418853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3628370/766660504/be9b3f32ea6114f99d427d0de44aa7ceb9e2f6f3/1750457164/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750418853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3628370/766660504/be9b3f32ea6114f99d427d0de44aa7ceb9e2f6f3/1750457164/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750418853","id":257146611,"name":"Gigaslave","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146611/9a15ecf5c8e82879168c24800ebde5f9217c097d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750418853"}],"name":"\u6838\u91d1\u98ce\u66b4(GigaSlave\uff09","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows7  The above.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3 4170 2.0ghz The above.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2G<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10  The above.<br></li><li><strong>Pr